          _n_e_l_/_c_o_r_e___u_s_e_s___p_i_d  contains the value 0.  (These files are described
          below.)  Note that if  _/_p_r_o_c_/_s_y_s_/_k_e_r_n_e_l_/_c_o_r_e___p_a_t_t_e_r_n  is  empty  and
